.\" purposeos.1 - Manual page for PurposeOS
.TH PURPOSEOS 1 "May 2026" "PurposeOS 2.0.0" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
purposeos \- Linux desktop automation daemon for reminders, scheduled actions, notes, and focus statistics

